                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "It was wonderful to welcome dozens of Mainers to my office for another Constituent Coffee this week. We discussed numerous issues including cancer research funding, adult education, the National Science Foundation, addiction treatment, Maine\u2019s community colleges, AmeriCorps, and the U.S. Forest Service.",
